What's new in this update:

• Your conversations now get a real name, written by the agent from what you actually talked about — no more lists full of whatever you happened to type first.
• A message you send while an agent is working can now reach it mid-task, without stopping it, so you can correct its course.
• A queued message looks like a normal message with a dashed outline, and you can still edit or cancel it until it goes out.
